window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>King Jack. The title was still foreign to Jack who had no love for the empire or the throne. But, with his loved ones secured and his daughter safe, Jack now has the opportunity to do one thing he never thought he could do.</p> <p>Be a father.</p> <p>At least, that's his plan. But no plan survives contact with the enemy and time waits for no one. Especially as the elusive Smiling Man finally shows his hand.</p>"; 
